        },
        {
          "text": "Hojatuni isa gaari keesaa isa fuute, gaari d'ibi keesa keete, Yerusalemuti geesite. Inni achi due awaala hayyoota keesati awaalani, jennaani worri Yudatifi ka Yerusalemu ch'ufti aka male isaa bohe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
